 usical guests and performers will entertain us at this fun event.\nAdmissi
 on to this event is offered on a sliding (pay what you can) scale basis.\n
 The Harmony Award was created in 2025 to honor community members who have 
 demonstrated their dedication to OCA\, supporting the arts\, and supportin
 g their community. We are honored to present the 2026 award to Patrick Fan
 ning.\nGet Tickets
