BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:John Prine Tribute with David Luning\, Jason Crosby\, Ben Dubin\, 
 Dave Zirbel and Victoria George
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T200000
UID:6a137d11fdf9506a76bad2f3@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:David Luning\, who attended Harmony School (now OCA) returns t
 o our stage for a special tribute celebrating John Prine's birthday. David
  will be joined by impressive musical colleagues Jason Crosby\, Ben Dubin\
 , Dave Zirbel and Victoria George.\nTickets are $35\, $30 for OCA members.
 \nGet Tickets\nThis show will take place in our auditorium. Doors open at 
 5:30 PM.\nDavid Luning knew at a young age the path his life should take. 
 Throughout generations\, troubadours and singers have harnessed the cultur
 al landscape and passed it along\, with the likes of John Prine and Townes
  Van Zandt paving the way with the telling of their stories. Following in 
 those footsteps\, the Sonoma County singer/songwriter's new record is the 
 product of a massive turn in his life and taps into that cultural archive.
  Listening to ‘Souvenirs’ by John Prine\, was a cornerstone moment\, c
 ompelling Luning to leave Berklee College and follow in the tradition of t
 hese iconic troubadours.\nLearn more about David Luning.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/david-lunin
 g-friends
X-SOURCE:Occidental Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
